"Enabled by default; you can turn this off. Sends crash reports, error codes, app/OS versions and operation timing to Sentry in the US. Passwords, usernames, server addresses, share paths and MAC addresses are excluded. Sentry processes the connection IP address; IP and inferred location are scrubbed on the server. Turning this off stops new collection and attempts to delete the local diagnostic cache. Reports already queued may still be delivered; reports already sent cannot be recalled." = "Enabled by default; you can turn this off. Sends crash reports, error codes, app/OS versions and operation timing to Sentry in the US. Passwords, usernames, server addresses, share paths and MAC addresses are excluded. Sentry processes the connection IP address; IP and inferred location are scrubbed on the server. Turning this off stops new collection and attempts to delete the local diagnostic cache. Reports already queued may still be delivered; reports already sent cannot be recalled.";
